SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Holy Cross\, Mytilinioi
LOCATION:Mytilinioi\, Samos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Once 'the largest panigiri in the area'\, the Stavros feast of Mytilinioi has been revived by the village association and is held on the eve\, 13 September\, from 20:00 in the central square with the village's traditional musicians. The Cross is also kept on 14 September at Mavratzaioi and the Timiou Stavrou monastery nearby. Late-season\, mostly Samians.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#mytilinioi-panigiri-of-the-holy-cross-mytilinioi
